flowchart TD
  accTitle: Versa Estate architecture
  accDescr: The browser uses TanStack Query factory hooks. Queries go through PostgREST and Row Level Security to the tables. Workflow steps (reserve, activate, verify, bill) go through RPC to security-definer functions, and guard triggers reject direct status edits. pg_cron runs expiries, the lease lifecycle and the overdue digest, Realtime drives the notification bell, and the Next.js server refreshes sessions and handles member invites.

  browser["Browser: TanStack Query factory hooks"]
  browser --> rest["PostgREST"]
  rest --> rls["Row Level Security policies"]
  browser -- reserve, activate, verify, bill --> rpc["RPC"]
  rpc --> fns["Security-definer functions"]
  rls --> db[("Postgres tables, guard triggers")]
  fns --> db
  browser --> server["Next.js server: session refresh, member invites"]
  server --> db
  db --- cron["pg_cron: expiries, lease lifecycle, overdue digest"]
  db -- Realtime --> bell["Notification bell"]
